   "postDate": "2026-10-03T05:26:22.783Z",
   "rawMarkdown": "I made a submission, but the notebook failed due to a path error. However, in the **Submission** tab, it is still showing as Running even after 1 hour.\n\nI then made another submission. The notebook ran successfully on 3 test studies in about 5 minutes, but the submission has now been loading for more than 1.5 hours and is still showing as running.\n\nDoes Kaggle allow only one submission to run at a time? If the previous submission is stuck, could that be preventing my new submission from completing?\n\nWhen I open the submission, it shows “Notebook failed and terminated”, but in the main **Submission** screen, it still shows Running.\n\nHow can I terminate or cancel the stuck submission? Any help would be appreciated.\n",
   "content": "<p>I made a submission, but the notebook failed due to a path error. However, in the <strong>Submission</strong> tab, it is still showing as Running even after 1 hour.</p>\n<p>I then made another submission. The notebook ran successfully on 3 test studies in about 5 minutes, but the submission has now been loading for more than 1.5 hours and is still showing as running.</p>\n<p>Does Kaggle allow only one submission to run at a time? If the previous submission is stuck, could that be preventing my new submission from completing?</p>\n<p>When I open the submission, it shows “Notebook failed and terminated”, but in the main <strong>Submission</strong> screen, it still shows Running.</p>\n<p>How can I terminate or cancel the stuck submission? Any help would be appreciated.</p>",
